Subject: [PATCH] refactor(kanban): expose pure whole-set lane ordering
 [daveey]

Reuse actual lane partition and interleave semantics for alternate-pending replay. Preserve live reader short circuits, default-lane fallback and claim-refused candidates charging their lane. This does not activate traces or certify fairness. Proof: 500-case frozen-algorithm differential test, pending-subset and within-tick regressions, caller read-count and identity controls; all lane and scorer consumers pass.
